# The staccato preset on the arp track, sixteenths up the keyboard with two voices overlapping.
tempo 120
steps 32
tail 1.5
track arp
sample ../opzk_piano.aif samplepacks/opzk_piano.aif
preset 140 165 0 70 0 12 0 0 128 0 128 215 0 0 0 0 0 0
note 0 36 1 60
note 2 40 1 64
note 4 44 1 68
note 6 48 1 72
note 8 52 1 76
note 10 56 1 80
note 12 60 1 84
note 14 64 1 88
note 16 68 1 92
note 18 72 1 96
note 20 76 1 100
note 22 80 1 104
note 24 84 1 108
note 26 88 1 112
note 28 92 1 116
note 30 96 1 120
expect sound 0 30
expect peak_below 0
